+  " AF1 APrxMedGamma2ToPQ(AF1 a) { AF1 b = AF1_AU1((AU1_AF1(a) >> AU1_(2)) + AU1_(0x2F9A4E46)); AF1 b4 = Quart(b); return b - b * (b4 - a) / (AF1_(4.0) * b4); }",
